{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-bluebell-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"bluebell-residence-gj-properties-al-yasmeen","about":"Bluebell Residence is a modern residential complex by developer GJ Properties consisting of a multi-storey building, the design of the facades are decorated with the iconic bluebell flower, symbolizing Ajman's close connection with the lush greenery and environment of the area. For sale are elegant 1, 2 bedroom apartments designed to the highest standards with luxurious finishes and spacious layouts. The interiors are designed in a modern style with the use of delicate shades, which creates a cozy atmosphere. The main feature of each residence are private balconies where residents can relax and enjoy the picturesque views of the city scenery.World-class amenities for residents include a gym, recreation area and retail outlets. Bluebell Residence has everything necessary for living and working in the immediate vicinity: kindergartens, shopping and office centers, stores and cafes, parks, sports and playgrounds. The location of the complex allows you to enjoy the proximity of children's development centers, international schools, medical centers.Bluebell Residence has a favorable location near Sheikh Mohamed Bin Zayed Road. Al Hamidiya Park is 3 minutes away, Ajman Beach and Al Zorah Natural Reserve are just 15 minutes away. City Center Ajman is 18 minutes away.","price":496837,"title":"Bluebell Residence","bitrix":{"id":666,"pf_id":"are.2.12544","source":null,"project_id":"Bluebell Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Bluebell Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"GJ Properties","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1188/images/2024/02/28/340x252/B80tx3Sfkw0x64fB8F6ej2uQGiCu9ZvR14bkybG4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloud